Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> program
Rule 1     program -> stmt
Rule 2     program -> program SEMI stmt
Rule 3     program -> program SEMI
Rule 4     stmt -> VAR ASSIGN VAR PLUS INT
Rule 5     stmt -> VAR ASSIGN INT PLUS INT
Rule 6     stmt -> WHILE LPAREN VAR NEQ INT RPAREN LBRACE program RBRACE
Rule 7     stmt -> IF LPAREN VAR NEQ INT RPAREN LBRACE program RBRACE
Rule 8     stmt -> IF LPAREN VAR NEQ INT RPAREN LBRACE program RBRACE ELSE LBRACE program RBRACE

Terminals, with rules where they appear

ASSIGN               : 4 5
ELSE                 : 8
IF                   : 7 8
INT                  : 4 5 5 6 7 8
LBRACE               : 6 7 8 8
LPAREN               : 6 7 8
NEQ                  : 6 7 8
PLUS                 : 4 5
RBRACE               : 6 7 8 8
RPAREN               : 6 7 8
SEMI                 : 2 3
VAR                  : 4 4 5 6 7 8
WHILE                : 6
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

program              : 2 3 6 7 8 8 0
stmt                 : 1 2

Parsing method: LALR

